meta {
  name: Exchanges
  seq: 5
}

docs {
  Requesting someone's listing and arranging the hand-over on campus.

  Exchange: `id, listing, listing_detail, requester, seller, role (requester|seller),
  offered_price, offered_listing, offered_listing_detail, message, status, meetup_location,
  meetup_location_detail, meetup_time, responded_at, completed_at, created_at, updated_at`

  Status: `pending` -> `accepted` -> `completed`, or `rejected` / `cancelled`.

  Accepting reserves the listing (and the offered book in a swap). Completing marks both
  books completed and rejects every other pending request for them.
}
